<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/27/msa@/~cl_9__subsec_8__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "b" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/27/msa@> .
